      "title": "DDetailer",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "COMFYUI IMPACT PACK - How to use (DDetailer feature)\n\nhttps://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack?tab=readme-ov-file#how-to-use-ddetailer-feature\n\nThe face that has been damaged due to low resolution is restored with high resolution by generating and synthesizing it, in order to restore the details.\n\nThe FaceDetailer node is a combination of a Detector node for face detection and a Detailer node for image enhancement. See the Advanced Tutorial for a more detailed explanation. (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-extension-tutorials/Main/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/tutorial/advanced.md)\n\nPass the MMDetLoader's bbox model and the detection model loaded by SAMLoader to FaceDetailer. Since it performs the function of KSampler for image enhancement, it overlaps with KSampler's options.\n\nThe MASK output of FaceDetailer provides a visualization of where the detected and enhanced areas are."
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    }
